{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1fe173109e5ea5cb11d3a0cd23ea2b7fdeb78e9e73cc401869f569013dc53059","ja":"武道館公演に向かって","zh":"向着武道馆公演","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f64d3231ad238e78229bd3e88d556fc147313d46b49cf4ce12dcdfb4052a9283","ja":"……あっ！　流れ星！","zh":"……啊！流星！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"df86c931e014e449d305e051f94f215ed53533c3c7cd8d7ef1a25713a9f52864","ja":"ほんとに一瞬なんだね……。\nこんなに早いと、お願い事をするのって難しそう。","zh":"真的一眨眼就过去了呢……\n这么快的话，许愿好像挺难的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0165da2b4f2c61efd96a2bc76f443d4d5293297e0d3083c2441f04330a3ef097","ja":"よーし！　次の流れ星は、「武道館公演がぜーったい\n成功しますように」って、3回言うぞ～っ！","zh":"好～的！下一颗流星出现的时候，我一定要说3遍\n“武道馆公演绝对绝对要成功”～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"cfaf063b497e3443664e37098417bdc889a977377bf6983a20674136dd336d13","ja":"次って……いつ来るかわからないでしょ。\n待ってたら遅くなるかもしれないし、帰りましょう。","zh":"下一次……还不知道什么时候会来呢。\n一直等下去的话可能会变迟，我们回去吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"86f3ac7d43652e319db66f33c7cb11b64e43663b23af797b8df7ecc740f84483","ja":"ええ～！？　でも、武道館公演を成功させるために\nお願いしておきたいよー！","zh":"诶诶～！？　可是，为了让武道馆公演顺利成功，\n我想先拜托好嘛～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5329763010f77cf593ea7f1680e8f44adcfea52ef78825ba673100864017d854","ja":"別に流れ星にお願いしなくても大丈夫でしょ？\n私達なら。","zh":"就算不向流星许愿也没关系吧？\n如果是我们的话。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6369ff130e8d721b572355d8054930c70b1a684fbff6d9af982a8b7c3ee641f1","ja":"にゃはは♪　たしかに、静香の言う通りかもね。","zh":"喵哈哈♪　确实，可能真像静香说的那样呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8f07f91632fb5246c5a45bfb6fc6652067783f67b019e1a480500d5aa91a8b1c","ja":"えへへ、そっか……そうだよね。\nじゃあ帰ろっか。","zh":"嘿嘿，这样啊……也是呢。\n那我们回去吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ca2692dd68a6e2e8e845ebb198d3bdb43ff2d76645673b31aa91ff3db56d3b08","ja":"あと何回寝たら、武道館公演だろう……\n早く武道館公演の日になりますようにっ！","zh":"还要睡上几次，才到武道馆公演呢……\n真希望能快点到武道馆公演的那一天！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"537048262c0c2b172224741bb2a8b0976e5f8247616d2555f6948c46090bbf5d","ja":"えっ……！？　ちょ、ちょっと、未来！","zh":"诶……！？等、等等，未来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"95616f7e5f7289ccf5f635f8b368ae63f48f78208fd72981d0f416628d0e2b03","ja":"ちょっと、未来！\n急に走り出して、どうしたの！？","zh":"等一下，未来！\n突然跑起来，怎么了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"fc1ced757e2ba2021b543047853d26a7e5f182da19c07d1c39ad0a2114c61684","ja":"でへへ～。はやく寝たら、明日がすぐ来るかな～って！\nそしたら、武道館公演も早く来るよね♪","zh":"嘿嘿～。我想着早点睡的话，明天是不是就会马上到呢～！\n那样一来，武道馆公演也会早点到来吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"983e4f94b0e61c692f9393d063b6b5191f26a9aba1be043c407db5926b7db571","ja":"何それ……ふふっ、もう未来ってば！","zh":"那是什么啊……呵呵，未来真是的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1163.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"f86d2f2df3ef1e4cdd12082e64f7e672022b56caaa2ed09982e06754e6a4e114","ja":"それじゃあ急いで帰らないとだね！\n武道館公演まで、走り続けよっ！","zh":"那就得赶快回去了呢！\n直到武道馆演出为止，全力冲刺吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
